OL,3,ATrump posthumously pardons US baseball
OL,4,Alegend Pete Rose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe baseball star was posthumously
OL,7,Freinstated to MLB, in which he played
OL,8,Ffor 24 seasons, last year and made
OL,9,Feligible for the Baseball Hall of Fame.
